        "y1": 0.9197418171326481
      },
      "text": "In the previous experiments, we used platform with 256-core   processor and 120 GB of RAM to run OUr algorithm. However; this does not imply that the algorithm proposed in this paper is limited  to such high-end con figurations; was chosen  solely to meet  the specific requirements of the experiments. Our algorithm is capable of running life and can even outperform the results obtained in the aforementioned experiments   because   personal   computers algorithm is implemented using more efficient programming languages; such as C or C++, the performance of loading results within the same time limit will be further enhanced. Table presents the algorithm's performance on widely used PC with an Intel i7-137OOK CPU, I6GB of RAM, and the Windows 11 operating system; standard datasets . using",
